{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o004a","title":"孙策卒授权孙权张昭劝其出巡军","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o004a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙策卒授权孙权张昭劝其出巡军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o004a-q"]},{"id":"wuzhu-a-p074-judgment","label":"《傅子》","text":"《傅子》评孙策创业和孙权继业任用辅臣。","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p074-judgment"]},{"id":"shiyi-a-b5cfe619240bdbe2b7e6","label":"正文","text":"孙策薨","evidence":["shiyi-q-0871145030892ec424ea"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"卒而传事","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o004a-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"承事巡军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o004a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0133","role":"劝勉","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o004a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":200,"label":"建安五年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y200","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o004","basis":"建安五年"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o004a-q","wuzhu-q-o004","sunshi-q-o034","xunyu-q-o020","xunyu-q-b-3c961618b484f81c3582"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o004a-q","source_order":[47,17,"O004a"],"order":8149}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0133","name":"张昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0099","name":"孙策","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shiyi-q-0871145030892ec424ea","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-274cf27e18898b898671","layer":"original","quote":"策薨","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":2},{"id":"sunshi-q-o034","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-8480cc17db549540a4f6","layer":"original","quote":"建安五年，曹公与袁绍相拒于官渡〖1〗。策阴欲袭许〖2〗，迎汉帝〖3〗；﹝一﹞密治兵，部署诸将。未发，会为故吴郡太守许贡客所杀〖4〗。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":260,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":66},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o004a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-d714325f2e71e77ac236","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖2〗，策薨，以事授权；权哭，未及息，策长史张昭谓权曰：“孝廉！此宁哭时邪〖3〗？且周公立法，而伯禽不师〖4〗；非欲违父，时不得行也〖5〗。﹝一﹞况今奸宄竞逐〖6〗，豺狼满道；乃欲哀亲戚，顾礼制；是犹开门而揖盗〖7〗，未可以为仁也！”乃改易权服〖8〗，扶令上马，使出巡军。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o004","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-d714325f2e71e77ac236","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖2〗，策薨，以事授权；权哭，未及息，策长史张昭谓权曰：“孝廉！此宁哭时邪〖3〗？且周公立法，而伯禽不师〖4〗；非欲违父，时不得行也〖5〗。﹝一﹞况今奸宄竞逐〖6〗，豺狼满道；乃欲哀亲戚，顾礼制；是犹开门而揖盗〖7〗，未可以为仁也！”乃改易权服〖8〗，扶令上马，使出巡军。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p074-judgment","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-eb4aec6022f5ccc2cdb2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《傅子》曰：“孙策为人，明果独断，勇盖天下。以父坚战死，少而合其兵，将以报仇；转斗千里，尽有江南之地；诛其名豪，威行邻国。及权继其业，有张子布以为腹心，有陆议、诸葛瑾、步骘以为股肱，有吕范、朱然以为爪牙。分任授职，乘间伺隙，兵不妄动：故战少败，而江南安。”","attribution":"《傅子》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":327,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f01122c5984bbf8c6107","start":0,"end":131},{"id":"xunyu-q-b-3c961618b484f81c3582","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-3c961618b484f81c3582","layer":"modern","quote":"〖3〗五年：建安五年（公元 200）。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":115,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3bbb3ef01ba77a895b2f","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xunyu-q-o020","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-ae8147f907358950d8ac","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖3〗，与绍连战。太祖保官渡，绍围之；太祖军粮方尽，书与彧，议欲还许，以引绍〖4〗。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
